  tally 2
  note "C-03 · Our return for 2024 (questions.md), as of and known as of 2025-12-31. One line per filing, f_filed as we filed it (2025-04-28) and f_corrected as we corrected it (2025-10-20): (filing, Marta base, Jan base, deduction Marta, deduction Jan, combined base, joint tax, child relief, credit, due, advances, difference: positive payable, negative refunded). paid with it: the corrected difference less the filed one. tenth: 2024's tenth by the return as filed and as corrected (C-HR6 .2), the 21 300.00 given (our estimate), and what the next December's gift carries: the tenth by the return as last filed before it (the corrected one) less the estimate, positive added, negative taken off."

